  <text xml:lang="grc"><body xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.eriphyle.dindorf1893-grc1"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.eriphyle.dindorf1893-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_eriphyle"><head>ΕΡΙΦΥΛΗ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="202" xml:id="fragment-eriphyle-dindorf1893_grc1-202" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_eriphyle" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.eriphyle.nauck1889grc1:195">
            <note type="source">Stobæus I, 1.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ἀρετῆς βέβαιαι δ᾽ εἰσὶν αἱ κτήσεις μόναι.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="203" xml:id="fragment-eriphyle-dindorf1893_grc1-203" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_eriphyle" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.eriphyle.nauck1889grc1:196">
            <note type="source">Stobæus VII, 7.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ἀνδρῶν γὰρ ἐσθλῶν στέρνον οὐ μαλάσσεται.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="204" xml:id="fragment-eriphyle-dindorf1893_grc1-204" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_eriphyle">
            <note type="source">Stobæus XLIII, 7.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ὅπου δὲ μὴ τἄριστ᾽ ἐλευθέρως λέγειν</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="205" xml:id="fragment-eriphyle-dindorf1893_grc1-205" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_eriphyle" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.eriphyle.nauck1889grc1:197">
            <note type="source">Stobæus XCIX, 20.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Πῶς οὖν μάχωμαι θνητὸς ὢν θεία τύχῃ,</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">ὅπου τὸ δεινὸν ἐλπὶς οὐδὲν ὠφελεῖ;</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="206" xml:id="fragment-eriphyle-dindorf1893_grc1-206" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_eriphyle" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.eriphyle.pearson1917-grc1:193">
            <note type="source">Stobæus CXVII, 3.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Γήρᾳ προσήκων σῶζε τὴν εὐφημίαν.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="207" xml:id="fragment-eriphyle-dindorf1893_grc1-207" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_eriphyle" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.eriphyle.nauck1889grc1:198">
            <note type="source">Clemens Strom. VI. p. 741.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ἄπελθ᾽· ἐκείνης ὕπνος ἰατρὸς νόσου.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="commentary">In Clemente legitur ἄπελθ᾽ ἐκείνης ὕπνον ἰατρὸν νόσου. Correxit Valckenar. ad Hippolyt. p. 313.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="208" xml:id="fragment-eriphyle-dindorf1893_grc1-208" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_eriphyle" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.eriphyle.nauck1889grc1:199">
            <note type="source">Appendix Vat. Proverb. ΙΙ, 49.</note>
            <note type="commentary">Καὶ γὰρ Ἀργείους ὁρᾷς: αὕτη Σοφόκλειος. πεποίηται γὰρ Ἐριφύλη πρὸς Ἀλκμαίωνα λέγουσα</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Καὶ γὰρ Ἀργείους ὁρῶ.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="commentary">εἴρηται δὲ ἐπὶ τῶν ἐκτενῶς πρὸς ὁτιοῦν βλεπόντων καὶ καταπλησίον (καταπληκτικόν Brunck.) τι δοκούντων ὁρᾶν. οἱ δὲ ἐπὶ τῶν εἰς κλοπὴν ὑπονοουμένων. κωμῳδοῦνται γὰρ Ἀργεῖοι ἐπὶ κλοπῇ, ὡς καὶ Σοφοκλῆς ἐχρήσατο.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="209" xml:id="fragment-eriphyle-dindorf1893_grc1-209" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_eriphyle" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.eriphyle.nauck1889grc1:192">
            <note type="source">Ioannes Damasc. in Gaisfordi appendice ad Stobæum vol. IV. p. 13. Σοφοκλέους Ἐριφύλῃ</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">* γλῶσσ᾽ ἐν οἷσιν ἀνδράσιν τιμὴν ἔχεις,</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">ὅπου λόγοι σθένουσι τῶν ἔργων πλέον.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="apparatus">V. 1. 'H supplet Brunckius et ἔχει scribit. Fort. 2 γλῶσε, ἐν οἷοις.</note>
          </div>
        </div></body></text></TEI>
